<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/img/logo-uv.svg" type="image/x-icon">
  <title>Recuperar Contraseña - UV Archiver</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/login.css" />
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="auth-container">
      <div class="image-login">
        <picture>
          <img src="/img/VectorBlue.png" alt="Vector azul">
        </picture>
      </div>

      <form class="login-form" id="forgotPasswordForm">
        <div style="width: 100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <img src="/img/logo-uv.svg" alt="logo-uv" style="width:100px;height:100px;object-fit:contain;">
        </div>
        <div class="logo" onclick="location.href='/'" style="scale:1.3; align-self: center; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;">
          <span style="color:var(--primary-color-accent);">U</span>
          <span style="color:var(--secondary-color);">V</span>
          Archiver
        </div>
        <h2 style="margin-top: 15px;">Recuperar Contraseña</h2>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 25px; padding: 0 10px;">
          Ingresa tu correo electrónico registrado y te enviaremos las instrucciones para restablecer tu contraseña.
        </p>

        <div class="input-group">
          <input type="email" id="correo" name="correo" required placeholder=" " />
          <label for="correo">Correo Electrónico</label>
        </div>

        <div id="recoveryResultBox" style="display: none; width: 100%; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; background: rgba(3, 118, 255, 0.08); border: 1px solid var(--primary-color-clear); border-radius: 10px; text-align: center;">
          <p id="recoveryResultMessage" style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--primary-color-dark); margin-bottom: 10px;"></p>
          <a id="recoveryActionLink" href="#" style="display: none; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--primary-color-accent); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">
            Continuar al restablecimiento de contraseña
          </a>
        </div>

        <button class="btn" type="submit">Enviar Enlace</button>

        <div class="register-link" style="margin-top: 15px;">
          <a href="/login">Volver a Iniciar Sesión</a>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="/js/utils/toast.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/auth.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
